<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nTo unlock the door to the\fradio transmitter, you need the\fvoice of a certain person.\rThat person is Petrel,\nthe Fed Executive!\rI found out he hidin’ in their\nleader’s office!\rProblem is, that room is\nlocked with a password too...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWe need the password to their\fleader’s office first!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nTo unlock the door to the\fradio transmitter, you need the\fvoice of a certain person.\rThat person is Petrel,\nthe Fed Executive!\rI found out he hidin’ in their\nleader’s office!\rProblem is, that room is\nlocked with a password too...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWe need the password to their\fleader’s office first!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Urrggh...\nThe dude in the cape is CRAZY\ftough...and I folded and\fsnitched on EVERYTHING about\fthis hideout...\rBut the boss office got\nTWO passwords! Ha! Top security!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\rSo you messin’ with them again.\rHmph, you must deadass like\nThe Feds a lot.\r...Tell me, who was the cape guy\nwith the Dragon-type homies?\rMy homies wasn’t no match at all.\rI don’t care that I lost. I can beat\nhim by gettin’ stronger homies.\rIt’s what he said that bug me...\nHe said I don’t love and\ftrust my homies enough.\rI’m heated I lost to a soft\nheart like him.\r...Hmph! I ain’t got time for\nthe likes of you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Muhahaha, we been waitin’ on you.\nSo you {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\rMe?\nYou don’t know who I’m?\rIt’s me, GIOVANNI.\nThe big dog Giovanni himself!\fWahahaha! *cough cough*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Huh?\nI don’t SOUND like Giovanni?\rI don’t even LOOK like Giovanni?\nBRUH. I practiced in the mirror\ffor THREE WEEKS!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Petrel: I’m a Fed Executive, lil bro!\rYou must be tryna sneak in the\nradio-transmitter room.\fNah, that ain’t happenin’.\rThat room locked with a special\npassword. The password is\f“In Giovanni We Trust.”\fWait... Did I just say that out loud?\rWhatever! Knowin’ it won’t help\nyou anyway.\rThe door only open when I say the\npassword. My voice only, bruh!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Petrel: Ever since The Feds got\nshut down three years ago, Giovanni\fbeen on read.\rBut he comin’ back. He just\nwaitin’ for the right time...\rWahahaha!\rYou beatin’ me don’t change\nNOTHIN’. You still can’t get in\fthe radio-transmitter room!\rIt need MY voice, bruh!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MURKROW: In Giovanni We Trust. Caw.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MURKROW is copyin’\nPetrel’s voice!\rBro just got finessed by a BIRD...!?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MURKROW: In Giovanni We Trust. Caw.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The door closed...\rIt need two passwords\nto open.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0114_D35R0104_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The door closed...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put in the\ntwo passwords.\rThe door opened!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
